iv></div></div></div></section><section id=\"architecture\" class=\"py-28 reveal-up reveal-slow reveal-delay-1\"><div class=\"mx-auto mb-16 max-w-3xl text-center\"><p class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-[var(--primary)]/20 bg-[var(--primary)]/8 px-3 py-1 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[var(--primary)]\">Core Infrastructure</p><h2 class=\"mt-5 text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight md:text-6xl\">The Architecture of <span class=\"text-gradient\">Trust</span></h2><p class=\"mt-5 text-lg text-[var(--text-muted)]\">The ballot box is rebuilt as a distributed cryptographic primitive with end-to-end assurance.</p></div><div class=\"grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4\"><article class=\"group glass-panel ghost-border relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl p-7 card-hover\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -right-10 -top-10 h-32 w-32 rounded-full bg-[var(--primary)]/10 blur-2xl opacity-0 transition group-hover:opacity-100\"></div><div class=\"mb-6 inline-grid h-14 w-14 place-items-center rounded-2xl border text-[var(--primary)] bg-[var(--primary)]/10 border-[var(--primary)]/25 transition group-hover:scale-110\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[26px]\" style=\"font-variation-settings:&quot;FILL&quot; 1\">lock</span></div><p class=\"font-mono text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-[var(--text-muted)]\">E2E</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-xl font-extrabold tracking-tight\">End-to-End Encryption</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--text-muted)]\">Every vote stays private from device to tally with layered cryptographic wrapping.</p></article><article class=\"group glass-panel ghost-border relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl p-7 card-hover\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -right-10 -top-10 h-32 w-32 rounded-full bg-[var(--primary)]/10 blur-2xl opacity-0 transition group-hover:opacity-100\"></div><div class=\"mb-6 inline-grid h-14 w-14 place-items-center rounded-2xl border text-[var(--secondary)] bg-[var(--secondary)]/10 border-[var(--secondary)]/25 transition group-hover:scale-110\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[26px]\" style=\"font-variation-settings:&quot;FILL&quot; 1\">account_tree</span></div><p class=\"font-mono text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-[var(--text-muted)]\">MERKLE</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-xl font-extrabold tracking-tight\">Merkle Immutability</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--text-muted)]\">Tampering with one record breaks proof integrity across the chain, making manipulation detectable.</p></article><article class=\"group glass-panel ghost-border relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl p-7 card-hover\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -right-10 -top-10 h-32 w-32 rounded-full bg-[var(--primary)]/10 blur-2xl opacity-0 transition group-hover:opacity-100\"></div><div class=\"mb-6 inline-grid h-14 w-14 place-items-center rounded-2xl border text-[var(--tertiary)] bg-[var(--tertiary)]/10 border-[var(--tertiary)]/25 transition group-hover:scale-110\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[26px]\" style=\"font-variation-settings:&quot;FILL&quot; 1\">fingerprint</span></div><p class=\"font-mono text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-[var(--text-muted)]\">ZKP</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-xl font-extrabold tracking-tight\">Zero-Knowledge Receipts</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--text-muted)]\">Confirm your ballot is counted without ever revealing your identity or your selection.</p></article><article class=\"group glass-panel ghost-border relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl p-7 card-hover\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -right-10 -top-10 h-32 w-32 rounded-full bg-[var(--primary)]/10 blur-2xl opacity-0 transition group-hover:opacity-100\"></div><div class=\"mb-6 inline-grid h-14 w-14 place-items-center rounded-2xl border text-[var(--purple)] bg-[var(--purple)]/10 border-[var(--purple)]/25 transition group-hover:scale-110\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[26px]\" style=\"font-variation-settings:&quot;FILL&quot; 1\">hub</span></div><p class=\"font-mono text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-[var(--text-muted)]\">CHAIN</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-xl font-extrabold tracking-tight\">On-Chain Anchoring</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--text-muted)]\">Receipt roots are anchored to a public ledger for an independent, tamper-evident source of truth.</p></article></div></section><section id=\"security\" class=\"py-28 reveal-up reveal-slow reveal-delay-2\"><div class=\"mx-auto mb-16 max-w-3xl text-center\"><p class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-[var(--secondary)]/20 bg-[var(--secondary)]/8 px-3 py-1 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[var(--secondary)]\">Security Standards</p><h2 class=\"mt-5 text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight md:text-6xl\">Hardened For <span class=\"text-gradient\">Resilience</span></h2><p class=\"mt-5 text-lg text-[var(--text-muted)]\">Three pillars keep every election verifiable, private, and attack-resilient.</p></div><div class=\"grid gap-7 md:grid-cols-3\"><article class=\"group glass-panel ghost-border relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl p-8 card-hover\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-[var(--primary)]/60 to-transparent opacity-0 transition group-hover:opacity-100\"></div><div class=\"mb-8 grid h-16 w-16 place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-[var(--primary)]/12 text-[var(--primary)] transition group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:rotate-3\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-3xl\" style=\"font-variation-settings:&quot;FILL&quot; 1\">shield_lock</span></div><p class=\"font-mono text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-[var(--text-muted)]\">AES-256-GCM</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight\">Military Grade Security</h3><p class=\"mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--text-muted)]\">Hardened cryptographic controls protect vote integrity from submission through final publication.</p></article><article class=\"group glass-panel ghost-border relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl p-8 card-hover\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-[var(--primary)]/60 to-transparent opacity-0 transition group-hover:opacity-100\"></div><div class=\"mb-8 grid h-16 w-16 place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-[var(--secondary)]/12 text-[var(--secondary)] transition group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:rotate-3\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-3xl\" style=\"font-variation-settings:&quot;FILL&quot; 1\">monitoring</span></div><p class=\"font-mono text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-[var(--text-muted)]\">LIVE MOTION</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight\">Real-Time Operations</h3><p class=\"mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--text-muted)]\">Active telemetry and anomaly watch keep election teams aware of suspicious patterns in real time.</p></article><article class=\"group glass-panel ghost-border relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl p-8 card-hover\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-[var(--primary)]/60 to-transparent opacity-0 transition group-hover:opacity-100\"></div><div class=\"mb-8 grid h-16 w-16 place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-[var(--tertiary)]/12 text-[var(--tertiary)] transition group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:rotate-3\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-3xl\" style=\"font-variation-settings:&quot;FILL&quot; 1\">verified_user</span></div><p class=\"font-mono text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-[var(--text-muted)]\">VERIFIABLE</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight\">Public Auditability</h3><p class=\"mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--text-muted)]\">Receipts and verification workflows make trust measurable for every participant and observer.</p></article></div></section><section class=\"py-28 reveal-up reveal-slow reveal-delay-2\"><div class=\"mx-auto mb-16 max-w-3xl text-center\"><p class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-[var(--tertiary)]/20 bg-[var(--tertiary)]/8 px-3 py-1 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[var(--tertiary)]\">The Voting Flow</p><h2 class=\"mt-5 text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight md:text-6xl\">From Ballot to <span class=\"text-gradient\">Public Proof</span></h2></div><div class=\"relative grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute left-[16%] right-[16%] top-10 hidden h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-[var(--primary)]/40 via-[var(--secondary)]/40 to-[var(--tertiary)]/40 md:block\"></div><div class=\"relative text-center md:text-left\"><div class=\"relative mx-auto grid h-20 w-20 place-items-center rounded-2xl brand-gradient glow-brand md:mx-0\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-white text-3xl\" style=\"font-variation-settings:&quot;FILL&quot; 1\">tune</span></div><p class=\"mt-6 font-mono text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-[var(--primary)]\">01</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight\">Configure</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--text-muted)]\">Authorize an election, define the electorate, and set cryptographic parameters in minutes.</p></div><div class=\"relative text-center md:text-left\"><div class=\"relative mx-auto grid h-20 w-20 place-items-center rounded-2xl brand-gradient glow-brand md:mx-0\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-white text-3xl\" style=\"font-variation-settings:&quot;FILL&quot; 1\">how_to_vote</span></div><p class=\"mt-6 font-mono text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-[var(--primary)]\">02</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight\">Cast</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--text-muted)]\">Votes are encrypted at origin and sealed before they ever reach the network.</p></div><div class=\"relative text-center md:text-left\"><div class=\"relative mx-auto grid h-20 w-20 place-items-center rounded-2xl brand-gradient glow-brand md:mx-0\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-white text-3xl\" style=\"font-variation-settings:&quot;FILL&quot; 1\">verified_user</span></div><p class=\"mt-6 font-mono text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-[var(--primary)]\">03</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight\">Verify</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--text-muted)]\">Receipts are anchored to the ledger and validation is one click away for every voter.</p></div></div></section><section id=\"verifier\" class=\"py-28 reveal-up reveal-slow reveal-delay-2\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center\"><p class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-[var(--primary)]/20 bg-[var(--primary)]/8 px-3 py-1 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[var(--tertiary)]\">Public Verifier</p><h2 class=\"mt-5 text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight md:text-6xl\">Trust, But <span class=\"text-gradient\">Verify.</span></h2><p class=\"mx-auto mt-5 max-w-3xl text-xl text-[var(--text-muted)]\">Every ballot receipt can be validated through the public verifier route with immutable audit references.</p></div><article class=\"glass-panel border-gradient relative mx-auto mt-12 max-w-4xl rounded-[2.4rem] p-8 md:p-12\"><div class=\"absolute -top-4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full border border-[var(--primary)]/35 bg-[var(--surface-container)] px-5 py-1.5 font-mono text-[11px] font-bold tracking-[0.16em] text-[var(--tertiary)]\">PUBLIC_VERIFIER_V2</div><div class=\"space-y-8 text-left\"><div><label class=\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[var(--text-muted)]\">Ballot Receipt ID</label><div class=\"mt-3 flex flex-col gap-4 md:flex-row\"><div class=\"flex-1 rounded-xl border border-[var(--border-default)] bg-[var(--surface-container)] px-5 py-4 font-mono text-[var(--primary)]\">SV-2026-X9F2-K881-LQ82</div><a class=